  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2308.06 Re-Training",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2308.06 Re-Training.\n\n(a) In the event a vessel agent is deficient in any area set forth in Saf-C 2308.05, the department shall require the vessel agent to undergo re-training.\n\n(b) Depending upon the areas of deficiency, re-training shall consist of one or more of the following:\n\n(1) Repeat the training program set forth in Saf-C 2308.05;\n\n(2) Repeat any portion of the training program; or\n\n(3) Undergo further training, the substance of which shall be determined by the department based on the vessel agent’s deficiency.\n\nSource. #5283, eff 11-22-91; amd by #5379, eff 4-21-92; ss by #6616, eff 10-25-97, EXPIRED: 10-25-05\n\nNew. #8506, INTERIM, eff 12-7-05, EXPIRES: 6-5-06; ss by #8617, eff 4-28-06, EXPIRED: 1-21-15 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 2300)\n\nNew. #10787, eff 2-20-15; ss by #14321, eff 7-16-25, EXPIRES: 7-16-35",
